### 1. Register a new vehicle asset (Super Admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "plateNumber": "LAG-9942-XD",
  "vehicleType": "VAN",
  "status": "IDLE",
  "lastMaintenance": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "nextMaintenanceDue": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 2. List all fleet vehicles (Tenant Admins)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 3. List vehicles filtered by status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/vehicles?status=IDLE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 4. Assign driver to vehicle
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/vehicles/VEHICLE_ID_HERE/assign-driver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "driverId": "DRIVER_PROFILE_ID_HERE"
}

### 5. Update vehicle maintenance dates
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/v1/vehicles/VEHICLE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "status": "MAINTENANCE",
  "lastMaintenance": "2026-08-11T12:00:00.000Z",
  "nextMaintenanceDue": "2026-11-11T12:00:00.000Z"
}
